-- Broaden Frontier Engineering OS positioning from electronics-focused to the full
-- Electrical & Electronics Engineering domain while preserving current-vs-roadmap truthfulness.
BEGIN;

UPDATE public.apps
SET
  category = 'Electrical & Electronics Engineering Platform / Instrumentation / AI / PCB & EDA',
  description = 'Frontier Engineering OS is a unified Electrical and Electronics Engineering operating environment that brings professional measurement, instrumentation, diagnostics, data acquisition, engineering intelligence, electrical power analysis, electronics design, PCB/EDA, component engineering, project management, technical documentation and manufacturing workflows into one extensible platform. Its scope spans signal-level electronics, embedded systems and PCB development through electrical machines, generators, transformers, power conversion, solar and energy systems, three-phase systems, industrial plant electrical work, power quality, protection, control and instrumentation. The current software foundation is operational as an installable PWA and simulator-first engineering workspace. Gen-1 physical instrumentation is still in engineering development and has not yet been fabricated, calibrated or certified. Future high-energy and hazardous-live electrical work will use dedicated modular, isolated and independently certified measurement interfaces rather than treating the current low-voltage prototype architecture as field-ready. The original AI PCB Matrix vision continues inside Frontier Engineering OS as Autonomous PCB Design Intelligence R&D, with the long-term objective of progressing from natural-language requirements to engineer-reviewed production-ready PCB and manufacturing outputs.',
  features = ARRAY[
    'Unified Electrical & Electronics Engineering operating environment',
    'Multi-instrument engineering workbench',
    'Digital multimeter interface',
    'Dual-channel oscilloscope interface',
    'Spectrum-analysis workspace',
    '8-channel logic-analyzer interface',
    'Signal generator / arbitrary waveform generator interface',
    'Universal engineering data logger',
    'Desktop multi-instrument layouts with collapsible sidebar',
    'Responsive tablet and mobile workspace behavior',
    'Projects and engineering sessions',
    'Project-scoped instrument workspace layouts',
    'Frontier Intelligence diagnostics framework',
    'Verified engineering knowledge base',
